Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.33,0:00:06.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:17.81,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.55,0:00:22.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.39,0:00:26.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:33.62,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:40.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.67,0:00:48.13,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:54.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.58,0:00:58.18,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.22,0:01:02.88,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.39,0:01:09.23,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.43,0:01:20.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.65,0:01:45.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:56.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:02:02.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第62话 高深莫测的阿椿咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.79,0:02:21.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:27.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你明白了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:29.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再怎么抵抗都是没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.93,0:02:32.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖的成为妖怪的饵食吧 犬夜叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.30,0:02:36.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要不用铁碎牙就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.07,0:02:40.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种杂碎妖怪 单手就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.94,0:02:42.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘴硬的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.01,0:02:47.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞刃血爪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:02.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.23,0:03:07.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.27,0:03:08.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:09.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:12.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要忘了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.61,0:03:17.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇的性命还在我的手上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.85,0:03:28.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 该怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.59,0:03:29.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.59,0:03:32.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:38.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题…没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:42.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 去帮助犬夜叉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.37,0:03:44.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样戈薇会撑不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.04,0:03:48.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…椿不论犬夜叉赢或输
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:51.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都打算咒杀戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.38,0:03:52.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.41,0:03:56.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 非得切断椿的咒术不可
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.62,0:04:01.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打倒椿 或打倒咒术媒介的式神
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:03.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.39,0:04:05.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇在倒下去之前曾说过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.43,0:04:07.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被不知名的东西咬了一口
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.76,0:04:11.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 那可能就是黑巫女的式神
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.07,0:04:14.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该就是那条蛇没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.64,0:04:16.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 麻烦你掩护我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.64,0:04:17.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:24.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:33.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破魔符吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:36.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别做无谓的挣扎了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:44.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢！我的咒术是不会破解的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.24,0:04:48.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.74,0:04:51.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:55.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞不清楚情况的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.24,0:05:01.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抵抗只会延长戈薇的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是说到不如
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:10.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就送戈薇上路算了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:14.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:16.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 振作点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.83,0:05:19.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:27.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚…我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:28.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:30.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:33.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么声音？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:35.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吵…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.78,0:05:36.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.15,0:05:38.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.22,0:05:39.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.49,0:05:42.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪…谁在叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.49,0:05:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:47.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 快点起床
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.73,0:05:49.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.23,0:05:50.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:53.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想睡到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.24,0:05:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.24,0:05:58.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:06:00.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师也…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.74,0:06:03.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会在这边的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:05.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你睡迷糊了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.75,0:06:09.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点起床了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:11.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要吃早餐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.03,0:06:19.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:23.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.27,0:06:25.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连早安都不会说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.77,0:06:27.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:28.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.04,0:06:32.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是什么时候回到这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.27,0:06:33.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:35.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有去过什么地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:37.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.55,0:06:39.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那边的世界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:41.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五百年前过去的世界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:45.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是进入隐密的井里面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:48.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来到有很多妖怪的战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.79,0:06:52.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你进去过那口井里面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:55.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是已经来回好几次了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:57.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连犬夜叉都有来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.93,0:06:58.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.07,0:07:00.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:02.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们连犬夜叉都忘了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.10,0:07:05.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.37,0:07:08.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这里长着狗耳朵的…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.95,0:07:12.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:16.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐 今天向学校请假比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:18.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是睡迷糊了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:22.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.53,0:07:32.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.27,0:07:35.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐 快迟到了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.27,0:07:38.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.71,0:07:42.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前的事情 全部都是梦吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.01,0:07:46.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.61,0:07:48.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点精神都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:50.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在烦恼什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.02,0:07:52.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是跟男朋友处的不好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.12,0:07:54.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:57.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了！你们还记得
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.63,0:07:58.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个男生的事情对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.86,0:08:00.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:03.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 果然不是在作梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.87,0:08:06.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,B班的北条同学吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.10,0:08:09.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:13.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是爱吃醋又粗鲁任性的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.27,0:08:14.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:16.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇你脚踏两条船吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.28,0:08:17.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.75,0:08:19.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇真有精神呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:31.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然还搞不懂状况
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.29,0:08:33.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是突然回到原来的生活了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:36.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.17,0:08:38.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:39.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着念下去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:41.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:44.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:45.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:49.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考试快到了 别再发呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.91,0:08:54.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考试
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.55,0:08:58.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错…我必须要准备考试
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:02.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我原本的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:04.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是我的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.69,0:09:05.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.19,0:09:07.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.56,0:09:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:13.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:16.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我听说日暮同学没什么精神
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.21,0:09:18.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个对身体很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.71,0:09:19.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,踩踩看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.67,0:09:20.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.71,0:09:25.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但还是哪里不太对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.81,0:09:28.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得这样下去不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:31.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要很多小孩呢 讨厌啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:45.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奶奶 买四魂之玉给我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:46.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.97,0:09:48.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.47,0:09:52.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说起这个四魂之玉的由来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.87,0:09:54.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要从战国时代… 走吧 奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.61,0:09:56.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.50,0:10:25.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小蚋 我觉得自己怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:28.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,许许多多的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.01,0:10:31.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在脑海里转来转去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.01,0:10:38.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉好像有一件非做不可的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:49.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要回忆起来的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:52.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愈来愈模糊了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:11:02.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然一直有一种不可以再这样下去的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.51,0:11:06.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但到底是什么事非做不可
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:18.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时感受到的脖子的痛楚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.19,0:11:20.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也渐渐的习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:22.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,思绪也变的无法止息了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.61,0:11:33.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:35.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:37.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.18,0:11:39.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要焦急
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.08,0:11:41.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么觉得不安
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.09,0:11:46.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.85,0:11:49.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 抱歉 北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.09,0:11:51.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.33,0:11:57.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.60,0:12:01.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你总算来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:04.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:06.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要试试看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.48,0:12:10.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为了这个而来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.12,0:12:15.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 那个标靶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.75,0:12:16.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好的瞄准
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:17.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:23.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,架式不错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.66,0:12:25.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,射中吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.13,0:12:29.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还早呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:32.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你的集中力不够
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.73,0:12:34.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问…请问你…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:35.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:38.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.81,0:12:41.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.28,0:12:45.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.15,0:12:48.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.32,0:12:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又会丧命的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.89,0:12:52.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:55.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:12:59.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:04.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.53,0:13:07.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬…犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:12.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.17,0:13:15.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还无法离开这个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:19.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.69,0:13:25.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.82,0:13:27.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是说这个的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.69,0:13:29.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界是你的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:31.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己决定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:33.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 回答我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:35.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.07,0:13:38.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:39.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.45,0:13:57.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:04.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.37,0:14:17.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么还能动
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:21.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的集中力不够吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.11,0:14:25.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你已经能耐住咒缚了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:27.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谣传你是桔梗转世
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:30.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎不全是唬人的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.75,0:14:34.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若是真正的桔梗 刚才那一箭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:37.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该能确实的命中我才对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.93,0:14:40.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底你不过是桔梗的赝品
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:42.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这人真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.13,0:14:45.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.13,0:14:48.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.27,0:14:50.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是其他人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:13.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢的家伙 这么急着找死
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.54,0:15:24.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:26.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.66,0:15:44.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:49.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样下去 戈薇会支持不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.80,0:15:57.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 能再稍微撑一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.37,0:16:01.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会努力试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.68,0:16:02.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.58,0:16:04.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那两人大卸八块
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.52,0:16:11.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不会让你被杀的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.45,0:16:15.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我闪开 杂碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:17.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.33,0:16:28.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到此为止了 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.77,0:16:35.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了不起 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.48,0:16:44.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.89,0:16:47.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死心吧 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:49.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太天真了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.89,0:16:52.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为这样就能切断咒术吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.43,0:16:53.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.40,0:16:56.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诅咒的效力还存在着
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.87,0:17:04.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有恢复
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.61,0:17:06.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是杀了式神吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.47,0:17:08.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.94,0:17:12.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你们几个也是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.66,0:17:30.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有妖怪在她的体内吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:33.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.48,0:17:44.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 留在戈薇的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:47.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.57,0:18:06.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,式神…该不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.01,0:18:15.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕！这些妖怪全都是诱饵
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.98,0:18:18.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在才发现太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.75,0:18:22.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,式神！咬断那女人的脖子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.25,0:18:24.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夺取四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.75,0:18:25.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.92,0:18:27.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 来不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:35.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.93,0:18:37.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这种人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:39.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这种人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:43.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这种人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:47.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这种人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.18,0:18:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会输给你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.95,0:18:52.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:01.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将式神打回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.26,0:19:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是咒术反噬！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:05.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和桔梗一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.13,0:19:07.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和那个时候一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.85,0:19:28.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会被这小丫头给…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.72,0:19:38.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉被净化了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.17,0:19:47.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碎片取出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.41,0:19:53.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:57.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她要逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.91,0:19:59.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想跑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.61,0:20:01.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住 臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.59,0:20:12.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:23.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.79,0:20:27.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.42,0:20:32.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.70,0:20:37.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样子好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.67,0:20:40.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片就那样给她？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.70,0:20:43.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么 马上就能取回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:44.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.71,0:20:46.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:50.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给黑巫女一个雪耻的机会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.68,0:20:55.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还蛮体贴的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.86,0:21:07.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耗尽力量了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.06,0:21:08.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是因为那些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.06,0:21:12.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饲养的妖怪统统死了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.30,0:21:14.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明就只差一步
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.80,0:21:18.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是只要有这颗四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.11,0:21:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能让我的力量更加强大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.14,0:21:25.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次我一定会打倒他们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.65,0:21:29.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做好觉悟吧 犬夜叉 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:38.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇十分疲倦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.13,0:21:40.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是不得已的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.90,0:21:43.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为她一直和咒术抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.63,0:21:46.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.00,0:21:48.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.77,0:21:51.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我在一起老是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.67,0:21:52.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:55.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我喜欢和你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.68,0:21:58.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.20,0:22:20.16,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.94,0:22:27.20,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.71,0:22:33.77,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.62,0:22:40.68,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.99,0:22:47.19,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.46,0:22:54.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.77,0:23:01.11,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.74,0:23:07.68,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.28,0:23:14.71,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.02,0:23:21.22,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.80,0:23:27.96,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.54,0:23:34.44,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.56,0:23:47.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.06,0:23:51.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女椿还持有四魂碎片吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.56,0:23:53.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么只有追过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.53,0:23:54.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们是怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.57,0:23:56.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿的同伴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.23,0:23:58.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红巫女与白巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.14,0:24:00.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是有够天真的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.57,0:24:01.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.57,0:24:04.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我骗了戈薇与弥勒他们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.84,0:24:06.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样说啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.84,0:24:09.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.55,0:24:11.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻挡在前的红白巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.82,0:24:14.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得好好振作了
